description:
eFootball PES 2020 is a football simulation game developed and published by Konami. It is the 19th instalment in the Pro Evolution Soccer series and the first to include the "eFootball" branding, reflecting Konami's focus on esports.

The Legend Edition includes:

- 1 player available from 11 Legend players;
- Premium Agent (30 weeks);
- 3 player contracts renewals (30 weeks);
- Lionel Messi as a loan player (10 matches);
- Ronaldinho 3D scanned version from 2019.
